    <string name="admin_log_verbosity_note">Set this to TRACE to reproduce something, then put it back. TRACE writes on every tick and every frame and fills the ring in seconds.</string>
    <string name="admin_log_persisted">Log on disk</string>
    <string name="admin_log_persisted_note">The log is written to disk as well, otherwise every crash that kills the process takes its own log with it. Wiping clears both the memory and the file.</string>
